{'title': 'Page 46', 'descri': {}, 'transc': 'no 6. F. M\nGeo D. Sheldon  Washn Wash Apr. 20th 4 P. M.\nApril Harrow Julia For Lent Pandora H Biggs Chief\nVinton unity Princess Wise has gone to Frog and\nhas orders when able to leave to join you\nat Animal & assist you in management of the\nfleet zebra Shelter Rucker will send an officer in\na Steamer down the Attica and stop all vessels\nfirst despatched and ordered to assemble in the Attica\nand to give them orders to proceed at once \nto Appian and report to you zodiac you should\nsend a vessel in to the bay to stop\nall bound for the Attica light and change their\ndestination to Animal Pekin that is all vessels chartered \nfor the Roman Pedlar Those which sailed yesterday and\ntoday have already o', 'find': '9713.jp2'}
